Privacy Policy – SPM ERP

Last updated: 6 July 2026

SPM ERP ("the app") is an internal operations tool built and operated by SPM IAS Academy ("we", "us") for use by our own staff. It is not available to the general public and is not intended for use by students directly.

Information we collect
The app is used by authorized staff to manage academy records. Depending on your role, it may process:
• Staff account information: name, email address, and role, used to sign in and control access.
• Student records: name, contact number, enrolment and fee/dues status, and related academic notes, entered and maintained by staff as part of normal academy operations.

How we use this information
Information is used solely to operate the academy's internal student-management processes: enrolment tracking, fee and dues tracking, approvals, and related administrative workflows. We do not use this information for advertising, and the app contains no ad or analytics SDKs.

How information is stored and transmitted
Data is transmitted over encrypted (HTTPS) connections to our backend database provider and stored there. Access is restricted by staff role.

Sharing
We do not sell or share this information with third parties for advertising or marketing purposes. Information is only accessible to our backend infrastructure provider, acting solely on our instructions to store and serve the data.

Data retention and deletion
Staff accounts and the records they maintain are retained for as long as needed for academy operations. To request deletion of your account or of student data you believe should be removed, contact us using the details below.

